$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Ymir" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Snow" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> are at it again. Each team has it's own base and flag-base. The two team bases are directly across from each other as well as the two flag bases. Here's the catch: there's a neutral/switchable base right in the middle of things. Whichever team can control this base will have the advantage of capturing the flag!" @
         "\n\n<f1>Designed by: <f0> Pokey" @
         "\n\n<f1>Special Thanks: <f0> Thanks for an awesome map editor tutorial Earthworm (http://www.seatac.net/earthworm/)! Your work is much appreciated!";
